    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0750" n="654" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg654"/>

                <head>No. 450.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Morris to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1870-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 6, 1870</date>.
                        (Received July 25.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Inclosed I transmit some statistical
                    statements respecting the Jews in Roumania. They will serve to give a correct
                    view of the real state of affairs in that principality; and in this point of
                    view I beg leave to suggest the expediency of the publication in English of the
                    inclosed article.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. JOY MORRIS.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d449-a1.xml" xpointer="d449-a1"/>
